A batteries-included framework for building web apps The full full-stack framework for Rust Topcoat is a modular, batteries-included Rust framework for building full-stack apps. It prioritizes simplicity and productivity. See Learn Topcoat to get started, or the Roadmap for what's coming next. Early-stage and experimental. Expect breaking changes. use topcoat::{
    Result,
    router::{Router, RouterBuilderDiscoverExt, page},
    view::{component, view},
};

